      "vocUsageNote": [
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "This property contains the CRS code of the coordinate reference system used for the geometry. A closed list of reference systems is supported: Lambert72, Lambert 2008, and WGS84. Lambert72 is currently applied in practice (like CRS code “3812”), while Lambert 2008 is included as the preferred target system in view of a planned transition."
